claim('4torah','17a:4','He asks for an open heart in Torah, a soul pursuing commandments, protection from evil encounter, inclination, wife and emerging evils, frustration of hostile plans and acceptance of his words and thoughts.',['Mar son of Ravina'],status='Continuation of same petition')
claim('5','17a:5','When fasting, Rav Sheshet prays that his diminished fat and blood be accepted like the sacrificial fat and blood that atoned when the Temple stood, and that he be favored.',['Rav Sheshet'],cond=['Fasting','After prayer'],status='Requested sacrificial analogy, not an asserted legal substitution')
claim('6end','17a:6','After finishing Job, Rabbi Yohanan says human beings end in death and animals in slaughter, all facing death.',['Rabbi Yohanan'],status='Reported reflection')
