claim('7','17a:7','Rabbi Meir’s habitual saying exhorts wholehearted study of God’s ways and Torah, keeping Torah in the heart and divine fear before the eyes, guarding speech and purifying oneself from sin, with divine companionship.',['Rabbi Meir'],status='Reported exhortation in divine first-person voice; distinguish utterer from rhetorical voice')
